     4	/**
     5	 * QUAL-06 and D-22: FIDELITY.md maps each ported Oolite mechanic to its
     6	 * Wegolite source and to the Oolite lines it follows, and quotes those lines.
     7	 *
     8	 * Two modes, one file:
     9	 * - Always on (every unit run and `verify`): the document's own structure and
    10	 *   the Wegolite side. Every row's Wegolite path exists and its line is inside
    11	 *   the file; every Oolite citation has exactly one excerpt with the same path
    12	 *   and range; every excerpt is at most 20 lines and its block is exactly its
    13	 *   cited range; every Fidelity cell is `faithful` or a divergence that quotes
    14	 *   a PROJECT.md Key Decisions row; the header commit equals
    15	 *   `third_party/oolite/pin.json`; and ASSETS.md carries one GPL-2.0-or-later
    16	 *   row for FIDELITY.md.
    17	 * - Verbatim (only when `OOLITE_SRC` names a directory that holds the pinned
    18	 *   tree, e.g. `git archive 7437f22 src` extracted there): every excerpt must
    19	 *   equal the cited lines of that tree. Without `OOLITE_SRC` this case is
    20	 *   reported as skipped, never as passed, because CI has no Oolite checkout.
    21	 */
